        107.69100189208984,
        548.01708984375,
        504.35089111328125,
        558.3359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and independently masks all tokens in the sequence x0. At time t = 0, the data point x0 is fully",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        559.4839477539062,
        504.3441467285156,
        570.0438842773438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "observed with no masks, while for t ∈(0, 1], xt represents latent variables with varying mask ratios",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        569.8350830078125,
        503.99462890625,
        580.9529418945312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
